{"id":"definitivamente","lemma":"definitivamente","pos":"adv","rank":850,"glosses":["definitely","definitively"],"ipa":"/definiˌtibaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-definitivamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Definitivamente creo que sí.","en":"I definitely think so.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455445"},{"text":"Fue definitivamente un engaño.","en":"It was definitely a hoax.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803830"},{"text":"Voy definitivamente a continuar.","en":"I'm definitely going along.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804339"},{"text":"Tu idea definitivamente merece ser considerada.","en":"Your idea is definitely worth thinking about.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598550"},{"text":"El parque temático fue cerrado definitivamente el mes pasado.","en":"The theme park was closed down last month.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804419"}]}